.TH CHM-PATCH 1 "2026-09-23" "Chimera II OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
chm-patch \- verified Chimera source-improvement pipeline
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-patch
propose|verify|stage|status
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manages proposed source changes produced from knowledge analysis. Builds, tests, hashing, signatures, staged deployment and rollback are required by policy. Privileged kernel, bootloader and security changes require administrator approval.
